    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have type 1... im feeling kinda scary right now. im super shaky and sweaty and my head feels all fuzzy and confused. i checked my sugar like an hour ago and it was definitely on the high side so i think it's still up... should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin now to steady things out?",
